{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/115-gen-con-2014","id":115,"title":"Gen Con 2014","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-10-13T13:50:01-07:00","id":115,"title":"Gen Con 2014","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">August 14-17 - Indiana Convention Center</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Gen Con Indy is the original, longest-running, best-attended, gaming convention in the world!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Featuring game industry veterans, award-winning authors and artists, jaw-dropping costumes, thousands of events, a growing Family Fun Pavilion, and the newest games on the market, Gen Con truly is </span></span><i>The Best Four Days in Gaming</i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">\u2122!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Gen Con is more than just a convention, however. It's a passion, a community, and a unique experience that keeps people coming back for decades.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The only way to truly understand Gen Con is to attend. Join us!</span></span></b> </div> </div> </div> <hr />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T10:51:22-07:00","id":279,"title":"","content":"I'll be there, certainly. =)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />&quot;The true object of all human life is play. Earth is a task garden; heaven is a playground.&quot; -G.K. Chesterton","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/53-blackwingedheaven","name":"blackwingedheaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar53_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T20:56:12-07:00","id":878,"title":"","content":"All I have to do is drive 15 minutes and I'm there. I love living in Indiana for the sole reason of GenCon. 2014 will be my 6th GenCon and I'm certainly not going to miss it. Hopefully I'll have a bigger apartment by then and maybe I can let a couple of you guys crash instead of paying for a hotel haha","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/268-darkling","name":"Darkling","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar268_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-01T23:03:42-07:00","id":925,"title":"","content":"I'll be attending again, had a blast this year. Definitely need a closer hotel next time, tho.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":65,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/65-the-invisible-voice","user":"the invisible voice","date":".  phone keyboard 11-02-2013, 02:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/65-t